{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/GIFS2-ezgif.com-cut.gif?t=1749492709\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your village survive or thrive? Rebuild your shattered home in this text-driven RPG. Gather scarce resources, hone your skills, and explore the troubled land of Demagost. Pick your battles \u2014 fight, negotiate, or flee. Your choices shape not just your story, but the fate of the kingdom itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790890/extras/GIFS.gif?t=1749492709\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Meaningful Story Choices</strong> \u2014 Shape Ronan\u2019s journey through decisions that affect the world and lead to multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Village Management &amp; Growth</strong> \u2014 Establish and grow your settlement, influencing its fate through quests and choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Narrative-Driven Adventure</strong> \u2014 Experience a branching story rich with character interactions and moral dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270d\ufe0f <strong>Use-Based Skill System</strong> \u2014 Improve your combat, speech, and survival skills naturally through play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized 2D Art</strong> \u2014 Handcrafted environments and characters bring the harsh world of Demagost to life.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790890?t=1749492709","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.ste